.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
CPP-API: \fBEmpty\fP logging implementation\&. 

Does nothing! Used by default if the application hasn't requested a custom logger via \fBDefaultLogger::set()\fP or \fBDefaultLogger::create()\fP; 
